/target
# Scratch output from the examples: generated Rust/Go projects, proof
# manifests, and JSON-lines run logs.
/out
/gen
/gen-project
nexus-out/
*.jsonl

# wasm-pack output (built by CI / `just wasm` and the Pages workflow), not committed.
/pkg
# The excluded `tpt-nexus-wasm` crate has its own (out-of-workspace) target dir.
crates/tpt-nexus-wasm/target/
# GitHub Pages build staging dir assembled by .github/workflows/pages.yml.
_site/
# Sibling repos checked out by CI (symlinked to ../<name>), not committed.
/_siblings/

# SARIF deltas emitted by `nexus diff --sarif` / the security-scan workflow
# (uploaded to the Security tab, not committed).
*.sarif

